From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] v8: coordinate shared memory and terminal Store lifetimes

Preserve memory copies across growth and attach shared memory with its owning
Store interruption state. Retire isolate pointers before Store destruction and
reject attachment and guest reentry after terminal cancellation. The ownership
wrappers introduced by the preceding patch are supplied here.

The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

